cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use olcaBASIC, please cite it as below."
title: "olcaBASIC"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A BASIC-like language for openLCA that enforces life cycle assessment
  modelling rules in code: background data reached only through bridges,
  validation before calculation, and EN 15804+A2 environmental product
  declarations built to the rules of the International EPD System.
authors:
